    <innerclass refid="struct_cursor_1_1_position" prot="public">Cursor::Position</innerclass>
    <briefdescription>
<para>Shared cursor descriptor for all pane types. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Describes what the cursor looks like and where it goes. Both Terminal and Whelmed build a <ref refid="struct_cursor" kindref="compound">Cursor</ref> from their own coordinate systems and draw it through their respective renderers.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para>lua::Engine::display.cursor </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para>lua::Engine::display.colours.selectionCursor </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
